# Sourcemaps are for local debugging only (sourcemap: "linked" in
# scripts/build.mjs); they never ship. NOTE: in vsce a `!` negation wins
# over every ignore regardless of order — so no blanket `!dist/**` here, or
# it would pull the maps straight back in.
**/*.map
!media/**
